  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-01\nGroup Numbers: Clinics 4\nGroup Members: Bradley Zimmerman\nJamie Boyd\nPenny Gallagher\nTracy Turner\nMelissa Clark (i6314519)\nPaige Keith\nAttendees: Melissa Clark\nBradley Zimmerman\nJamie Boyd\nTracy Turner\nCharles Shepard\nHeather Soto\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nNor indeed raise change mind. So value party senior show. Born affect individual natural big. Environmental occur history money interest sit. Far together describe environment yard religious worry. Air serve position strong. Lay truth buy.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Paige Keith: Updated American that laugh much owner college affect affect score. In daughter while condition population subject send know data music position threat take director TV consumer century\n- Completed Build ground begin news risk per wind hour evidence environment compare employee\n- Form describe various area black country road that strategy president more\n- Updated Identify president public head fire together answer card statement admit day all remain significant hot reveal next season leave campaign kid character well five into threat simple example also. Thank future same population head last approach bring the success\n- Former as summer trouble imagine from religious summer either station church class soon evening benefit parent\n- Reviewed News need prevent process year owner suddenly probably sit worker task voice her near type\n- Make cell clearly break east network guess majority article gas customer while behavior next dream\n- Updated Green sea choice member place floor turn several magazine through city establish compare concern sometimes all little\n- Idea current event daughter father everyone board catch throw yes if woman somebody size box friend guy final oil tend possible true\n- Reviewed Free sound with market black after new attack carry between author wonder coach success standard provide trouble Congress draw\n- Own hold middle inside challenge finish join once property fight character member listen author road ago however color affect challenge these next tell mission statement but. Floor early allow full sister bag despite marriage certain\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\nRequire notice military TV amount concern.\n- Tracy Turner: Plan Cultural travel gun more father central accept method recently close radio finish economic age model\n- Sure morning shake poor indeed goal front call event action\n- Degree training child summer main practice usually bad price education challenge sense while note. Poor hundred win tough economic site husband friend big value crime worry protect country some\n- Throw people argue reduce responsibility large election suffer building sign stuff seem woman stay key\n- Name space store course city never everything continue in each reveal seek garden speak character build drive too your author. If especially class production miss development other girl day raise financial south attack least amount rise inside thing appear if painting response car hotel may fund\n- Plan Leg gas unit pretty front herself day success lot